{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left\">內地國慶黃金周期間，全國有超過21.4億人次跨區流動。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">交通運輸部公布七天假期，每日平均有逾3億人次跨區流動，按年增長百分之0.6。另外，今個假期有逾1,546萬人次出入境，出境的內地居民有約444萬人次。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.ROUNDUP-1800_003.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Qyok3Pa0s01791463230.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"Picture_J.CN.ROUNDUP-1800_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">外國人入境有約68萬人次，超過七成是來自亞洲及歐洲遊客。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.ROUNDUP-1800_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026NChs8HDO3B1791463206.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"Picture_J.CN.ROUNDUP-1800_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-08T13:19:22.598684+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}